#created by Duel Circuit - Master Plan Marlo (SPYRAL, 2017)
#era 2017
#tier Alley headliner (docs/dev/HEADLINERS-2026-11-01.md)
#about SPYRAL Resort finds Super Agent, which summons itself on a guess; two agents make Double Helix, and Double Helix calls SPYRAL Master Plan from the Deck. Master Plan finds a MISSION, then Links off for Resort and another agent: the whole board from one search.
#why SPYRAL Master Plan, PSY-Framelord Omega and Blackwing - Gofu the Vague Shadow are Forbidden today; under the November 2017 list Master Plan was legal at three.
#source Format Library deck 65637 as built (decks/history/spyral.ydk, YCSMEL18): its one SPYRAL Master Plan is enough, since Double Helix calls it from the Deck (two finished 80% of goldfish games, over the 55-75% target)
#banlist TCG November 2017
